{"ID":"20240511110520-9mvim17","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240511110520-9mvim17","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240511110520-9mvim17\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240511122755-7t96a78\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240511133735-9nnooit\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240511160128-hggb4im\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"汉唐-085号（外用青春痘粉剂）","type":"doc","updated":"20240511160128"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240511122755-7t96a78","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511122755-7t96a78","updated":"20240511122755"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本品是采用中药中极滋润皮肤的药物，配制而成，简单易用，在涂抹之前，用清水把脸洗乾净，然後直接把粉涂抹在患处，睡觉前使用，次日清晨则洗去。"}]},{"ID":"20240511122755-ozye347","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511122755-ozye347","updated":"20240511122758"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本品是用有吸除油质以及清除发炎的中药，合并而成，如配合服用HT-79则效果加倍。"}]},{"ID":"20240511122755-9bv6flx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511122755-9bv6flx","updated":"20240511122759"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本品如不慎误服，亦无碍，毫无毒性。"}]},{"ID":"20240511122755-msd4zqv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511122755-msd4zqv","updated":"20240511122755"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"内容: 白芷……等。"}]},{"ID":"20240511122755-msd2ik2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511122755-msd2ik2","updated":"20240511122755"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不须医师处方，任何人有此症状皆可服用。"}]},{"ID":"20240511122755-wahlc67","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511122755-wahlc67","updated":"20240511122755"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"研发人∶美国佛州汉唐中医学院，院长倪海厦医师。"}]},{"ID":"20240511122755-eclcb7l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511122755-eclcb7l","updated":"20240511122755"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"着作权人∶同上。"}]},{"ID":"20240511133733-bzopql3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511133733-bzopql3"}},{"ID":"20240511133734-sr7ruko","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240511133734-sr7ruko"}},{"ID":"20240511133735-iz9x4ny","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240511133735-iz9x4ny","updated":"20240511133737"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"HT-85  外用青春痘之剂"}]},{"ID":"20240511133735-xxusqsq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511133735-xxusqsq","updated":"20240511133735"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2006.12.08B  录校：周胜陵）"}]},{"ID":"20240511133735-oskzx3r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511133735-oskzx3r","updated":"20240511160116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"青春痘的外用药，这一个磨脸的方剂，比敷药，中国有很多美容方法，配好后使用，对美容效果很好，治疗青春痘的方子是其中一种，配这种方子，古方不能全部拿来用， 古方的敷脸方，有的要用到铅粉的，一定要注意不可随便用，容易铅中毒，敷脸上的药粉，里面要是含铅的药粉用几次后，面部就特别白净，"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240511133735-mmse77s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511133735-mmse77s","updated":"20240511133735"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这是急于求成的办法，所以说古方中敷面剂，有的要用到毒药，要注意不可随便拿来使用，一定要注意以安全第一，然后美容美体为次，健康为第一，人的漂亮人的美关键是健康美，这也是体用，健康是其体，这健康美就包含了人的 身体与心理身心两方面的健康，这就是健康美。健康后才是形体，形体是属于次要的，人身体没有病，气血运转正常，脾气性情好，即使人丑点，没什幺，照样人缘特别好，如果这人特别尖酸刻薄，如同象林黛玉似的，虽然来说长的也很漂亮，但是一身的病，同时为人的性格尖酸刻薄，你看象林黛玉她有几个朋友？就没有朋友， 这就是不健康的美，我们提倡的是健康，属于这样的道理"}]},{"ID":"20240511133735-s87zl7t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511133735-s87zl7t","updated":"20240511160120"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"本品是采用中药中极滋润皮肤的药物，配制而成，简单易用，在涂抹之前，用清水把脸洗干净，然后直接把粉涂抹在患处，睡觉前使用，次日清晨则洗去。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240511133735-z22jxdj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511133735-z22jxdj","updated":"20240511160125"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"本品是用有吸除油质以及清除发炎的中药，合并而成，如配合服用HT--79则效果加倍。\n本品如不慎误服，亦无碍，毫无毒性。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240511160128-hggb4im","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511160128-hggb4im"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"内容: 白芷……等。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240511133735-9nnooit","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511133735-9nnooit","updated":"20240511133750"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"里面用白芷等，中药特别有意思，不是来说随便命名的，每个中药命名都有含义，好再看下一个。"}]}]}